Canonical project
-----------------

The only official Everchat software is published at
https://github.com/erikfiala/everchat, on https://everch.at, and in the
Chrome Web Store listing operated by the same publisher.

Permissions
-----------

Subject to these terms, you may:

1. Install and use unmodified official builds obtained from GitHub
   Releases on github.com/erikfiala/everchat, the official Chrome Web
   Store listing, or everch.at.

2. View, download, and copy the source code for personal review and to
   verify that an official build matches the published source.

3. Compile unmodified source solely to compare it with an official build.

4. Create a private working copy, including temporary modifications,
   solely to develop and submit a contribution to the canonical
   repository, and run that working copy on your own computer while
   testing the contribution. You may not publish that working copy or
   offer it to others.

5. Fork the canonical repository on GitHub only as a vehicle for such
   contributions.

